{"unit_id":"xmwengxing__dsh-sidebar-enhancement#feature-1","repo":"xmwengxing/dsh-sidebar-enhancement","commit":"1b00ba5fb8196ce5f93d1b273ad3739e687841c0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-sidebar-enhancement** 的功能「文件树管理」：文件树提供新建文件与目录、重命名、上传、下载、删除和复制完整路径等操作；用户可从侧边栏工具栏或条目菜单触发，操作对象是当前会话工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1505-1954","index.js:603-715"]}
{"unit_id":"xmwengxing__dsh-sidebar-enhancement#feature-2","repo":"xmwengxing/dsh-sidebar-enhancement","commit":"1b00ba5fb8196ce5f93d1b273ad3739e687841c0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-sidebar-enhancement** 的功能「可编辑文档预览」：打开受支持的文本文件后，可在预览区编辑内容并保存；保存请求携带读取时的版本，检测到磁盘变更时由界面提示冲突处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2036-2320","index.js:603-611"]}
{"unit_id":"xmwengxing__dsh-sidebar-enhancement#feature-3","repo":"xmwengxing/dsh-sidebar-enhancement","commit":"1b00ba5fb8196ce5f93d1b273ad3739e687841c0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-sidebar-enhancement** 的功能「底部多标签终端」：会话头部的终端按钮可显示输入框下方的独立终端面板；面板支持创建和关闭多个终端标签，并复用 DSH 提供的终端服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3507-3848"]}
{"unit_id":"xmwengxing__dsh-sidebar-enhancement#feature-4","repo":"xmwengxing/dsh-sidebar-enhancement","commit":"1b00ba5fb8196ce5f93d1b273ad3739e687841c0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-sidebar-enhancement** 的功能「快捷命令库」：终端旁的命令库可分组管理命令，支持送入当前终端运行、复制、备份和恢复；命令数据同步保存在 DSH 主目录文件中。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2710-2860","index.js:724-740","index.js:811-874"]}
{"unit_id":"xmwengxing__dsh-sidebar-enhancement#caveat-1","repo":"xmwengxing/dsh-sidebar-enhancement","commit":"1b00ba5fb8196ce5f93d1b273ad3739e687841c0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-enhancement 使用前须知：文件操作和编辑限定于当前会话工作区，终端面板则依赖宿主提供的终端、主题及侧边栏服务；缺少相关服务时该面板不会注册。（见 client.js:3823-3825）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3823-3825"]}
{"unit_id":"xmwengxing__dsh-sidebar-enhancement#caveat-2","repo":"xmwengxing/dsh-sidebar-enhancement","commit":"1b00ba5fb8196ce5f93d1b273ad3739e687841c0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"快捷命令库写入 DSH 主目录的 sidebar-enhancement/quick-commands.json；目录可由 DSH_HOME 指定，默认是 ~/.dsh。（见 index.js:724-740）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:724-740"]}
